Piarium structure runtime third-party notices
===========================================

This directory vendors WebAssembly used by the Application Host structure
provider. Only the TypeScript and TSX grammars are copied (D-091 / D-096).
Authorization and source paths are checked on every load, including cache hits.

1. web-tree-sitter
   Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/web-tree-sitter
   Pinned with @piarium/web's web-tree-sitter dependency (0.27.x)
   File: web-tree-sitter.wasm
   License: MIT. See LICENSE.web-tree-sitter.

2. tree-sitter-typescript / tree-sitter-tsx grammar wasm
   Published wasm from tree-sitter-typescript 0.23.2
   https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript
   Files: tree-sitter-typescript.wasm, tree-sitter-tsx.wasm
   Grammar license: MIT. See LICENSE.tree-sitter-typescript.
   ABI 14, compatible with web-tree-sitter 0.27 (MIN 13–LANGUAGE 15).

3. Piarium tree-sitter queries
   Adapted from Apache-2.0 query sets in Aider (paul-gauthier/aider) and
   nvim-treesitter (nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter). See queries.ts.
